{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_157","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > collab/5c-write-report.py <<'PY'\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\nfrom zoneinfo import ZoneInfo\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\n\nroot = Path('/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p5c')\ndef outcome(name):\n    s = (root / 'collab' / name).read_text()\n    m = re.search(r'Ran (\\\\d+) tests containing (\\\\d+) assertions\\\\.\\\\s*(\\\\d+) failures, (\\\\d+) errors\\\\.', s)\n    if not m:\n        raise SystemExit('Not complete: ' + name)\n    return tuple(map(int, m.groups()))\nnode = outcome('5c-node-slow-final.log')\njvm = outcome('5c-c4-final-jvm.log')\nif node[2:] \"'!= (0, 0) or jvm[2:] != (0, 0):\n    raise SystemExit('\"'Slow gate has failures; do not write a PASS report')\nfor name in ['5c-node-slow-final.log', '5c-c4-final-jvm.log']:\n    if (root / 'collab' / name).read_text().count('C4 scanner oracle complete:') \"'!= 8:\n        raise SystemExit('\"'Eight modules not complete: ' + name)\nnow = datetime.now(timezone.utc)\nheader = now.strftime('Completed-GMT: %Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S GMT\\\\n') + now.astimezone(ZoneInfo('Asia/Bangkok')).strftime('Completed-Local: %Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S Asia/Bangkok\\\\n')\nbody = r'''\n\nImplemented slice 5c within the six allowed source/test paths. Acceptance items 1–10 pass on JVM and Node; item 11 is not fully met because Dart test execution is sandbox-blocked and the orchestrator's broader gates were not run. This is an implementation report, not review or sign-off. Review/sign-off remains assigned to claude-fable-5-1.\n\n## Changed files\n\nNew:\n\n- \"'`src/cljc/yin/vm/semantic_register/scan.cljc`: admitted-vector scanners, exact closure-owner lexical scope, position-bearing records, segment-qualified rows, and Datalog requirements.\n- `test/yin/vm/semantic_register/scan_test.cljc`: the required matrices and named gates, independent FIFO map-AST emission oracle, malformed-vector checks, nil-key and conditio